  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Secretariat of the Committee on World Food Security ? Implementation of the CFS Multi</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of these activities is to leverage the convening power of the Committee on World Food Security (CFS), as the foremost inclusive
international and intergovernmental platform to discuss food security and nutrition (FSN) and coordinate collective action at all levels, reinforce its role in the context of the global governance of Food Security and Nutrition (FSN), and reinforce its presence and interactions with relevant global processes, initiatives, and institutions to identify potential areas of collaboration and maximize synergies.</narrative>
  </description>
